data: {"id": "09b199ad10394b90-thinking-parallel_evidence-1612", "run_id": "09b199ad10394b90", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论（aiops-case-v10/workload）\n\n### 1. 实体身份与当前生命周期\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v10/workload`，UID `d3e0dc86-6f8b-4f29-a50c-826bf2a1f1e6`，运行在 `node2`，Pod IP `172.16.104.19`。\n- **Phase**: `Running`（Kubernetes 层面 Pod 对象处于 Running），但 **容器未 Ready**（`containers with unready status: [app]`）。\n- **Restart Count**: 5（k8s describe）/ 4（Prometheus `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`，两者都表明有多次重启）。\n- **Container `app` Last State**: `Terminated`，**Exit Code 78**，Reason `Error`。\n- **Current State (describe)**:", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789140170418, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

